Subject: [PATCH] Stop searching the absent m4/intl directory

The release archive keeps its gettext macros in m4 and has no m4/intl
subdirectory. Remove the stale search path so autoreconf can run.

--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -1 +1 @@
-ACLOCAL_AMFLAGS = -I m4 -I m4/intl
+ACLOCAL_AMFLAGS = -I m4
